{"id":36740,"date":"2022-05-19T13:51:05","date_gmt":"2022-05-19T17:51:05","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/upwithwomenstg.wpengine.com\/?page_id=36740"},"modified":"2026-03-04T11:31:27","modified_gmt":"2026-03-04T16:31:27","slug":"who-we-are","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/who-we-are\/","title":{"rendered":"Who We Are"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__wrapper\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-wrapper\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background-holder\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background\"><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__foreground\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__content\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-top\"><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-heading-underline\" id=\"h-who-we-are\">WHO WE ARE<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p>Up With Women \/ Exponenti\u2019elles is a growing registered charity dedicated to helping low-income women and gender diverse individuals build sustainable, prosperous careers and businesses with the aim of permanently exiting poverty. We currently serve clients in five provinces, Ontario, Quebec, Alberta, British Columbia, and Nova Scotia, and in the official language of their choice.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-heading-underline\" id=\"h-what-we-do-0\">WHAT WE DO<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Up With Women clients undergo a year-long intensive program of career and entrepreneurship-based one-on-one customized coaching, in-depth personality and emotional assessment tools, group-support sessions, and soft-skills development. We partner clients with International Coaching Federation-certified professional coaches for twice-monthly career coaching. All coaches provide their services at pro-bono, thereby allowing Up With Women to deliver high quality service at a very low cost. One-on-one coaching is also supplemented by group peer learning sessions and referrals to other community resources, such as housing, legal and immigration. In addition to our main coaching program, graduates are offered the opportunity to continue their career development journey through such initiatives as our Community Leadership Program and a customized Employment and Entrepreneurship Development Program.<\/p>\n<\/div><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" src=\"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/Ana-for-website.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-41639 size-full\" srcset=\"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/Ana-for-website.png 750w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/Ana-for-website-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/Ana-for-website-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-top\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1002\" src=\"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/KL1_6300-Jemima-Karine-scaled-e1772641872319-1024x1002.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-43016 size-full\" srcset=\"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/KL1_6300-Jemima-Karine-scaled-e1772641872319-1024x1002.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/KL1_6300-Jemima-Karine-scaled-e1772641872319-300x293.jpg 300w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/KL1_6300-Jemima-Karine-scaled-e1772641872319-768x751.jpg 768w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/KL1_6300-Jemima-Karine-scaled-e1772641872319-1536x1503.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/KL1_6300-Jemima-Karine-scaled-e1772641872319.jpg 1745w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-heading-underline\" id=\"h-who-we-work-with-0\">WHO WE WORK WITH<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Up With Women\u2019s target population is marginalized and low-income women and gender diverse people. Our clients have experienced a large range of set-backs, including being recently homeless, at-risk of homelessness due to poverty, and\/or earning a living below the poverty line. We serve clients in English and in French.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-heading-underline\" id=\"h-why-we-do-it-0\">WHY WE DO IT<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Talented people are falling through the cracks. Many Canadians experience career interruptions due to life events \u2013 but the longer one is out of the job market, the harder it is to get back in. The cycle of homelessness and poverty can be extraordinarily difficult to escape. Up With Women gives the skills and opportunities to break the cycle.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/donate-secure\/\">Help us help more women!<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"template-gutenberg.php","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"_kad_post_transparent":"","_kad_post_title":"","_kad_post_layout":"","_kad_post_sidebar_id":"","_kad_post_content_style":"","_kad_post_vertical_padding":"","_kad_post_feature":"","_kad_post_feature_position":"","_kad_post_header":false,"_kad_post_footer":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-36740","page","type-page","status-publish